<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <title>Noah Humbert</title>
        {% include 'partials/_head.html.twig' %}
    </head>

    <body>
        <!-- Top Navitation Bar-->
        {% include 'partials/_navbar.html.twig' %}

        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="container mt-2 mb-2 text-center">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-12">
                    <p class="fs-1 my-0">Mentorship Program</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Top Screen Schedule button -->
        <div class="row mt-1 justify-content-center">
            <div class="col-lg-2 col-6 d-grid gap-2">
                <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://calendar.app.google/nyvMuGC8DBSDuFK3A">Book a Free Call</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!--  / Why Listen to me? -->
        <div class="container-fluid my-5">
            <div class="row justify-content-center mb-2">
                <div class="col-4 col-lg-4">
                    <div class="card" style="max-width: auto;">
                        <div class="row g-0">
                            <div class="col-12">
                                <div class="card-body">
                                    <h5 class="fs-2 mb-4 text-center">Why listen to me?</h5>
                                    <p class="fs-6">At 18, I was a 4.2 GPA student at the top of my class when I made the decision to build my own path instead of following the traditional college route.</p>
                                    <br>
                                    <p class="fs-6">I started working full-time in IT, gaining real-world experience and learning how businesses operate from the inside. Over the last year, I've helped implement and improve hundreds of business-critical processes while continuing to build my skills.</p>
                                    <br>
                                    <p class="fs-6">At 19, I purchased my first home.</p>
                                    <br>
                                    <p class="fs-6">To me, that wasn't just buying a house — it was proof that intentional decisions, discipline, and long-term thinking can create opportunities at any age.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-4 col-lg-4">
                    <img src=" {{ asset('images/noah.png') }} " class="card-img-top" alt="Noah">
                </div>
                <div class="col-4 col-lg-4">
                    <div class="card" style="max-width: auto;">
                        <div class="row g-0">
                            <div class="col-12">
                                <div class="card-body">
                                    <h5 class="fs-2 mb-4 text-center">Who It's For?</h5>
                                    <p class="fs-6">A lot of young adults leave high school with no clear direction<p>
                                    <br>
                                    <p class="fs-6 mb-0">They know they want more, but they don't know:</p>
                                    <p class="fs-6 my-0">- What career path to pursue</p>
                                    <p class="fs-6 my-0">- How to build valuable skills</p>
                                    <p class="fs-6 my-0">- How to manage money</p>
                                    <p class="fs-6 mt-0">- How to create discipline and consistency</p>
                                    <br>
                                    <p class="fs-6">I created this mentorship to provide the guidance I wish I had when I was starting out</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </body>
</html>